{B.38 = 38-41}
38.	Lady, throughout heaven and earth who knows from you the intentions of your heart, 
39.	those great matters? All heaven trembles (?) at your word, 
40.	a double-twined thread which cannot be separated. Your father @wDN{Enlil} has given this to you. 
41.	@wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana} competes majestically for you in battle, cutting a swathe like a dragon. 

