{B.46 = 46-49}
46.	My lady, @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana} trusts in you. 
47.	He cloaks his body as if in your royal robe of office. 
48.	Monthly at the crescent moon @wDN{An} recreates him for you like @wDN{Suen}. 
49.	People praise King @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, the beloved of your heart, like @wDN{Utu} as he rises. 

{B.50 = 50-53}
50.	@wDN{Inana}, my lady, @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana} trusts in you. 
51.	He cloaks his body as if in your royal robe of office. 
52.	Monthly at the crescent moon @wDN{An} recreates him for you like @wDN{Suen}. 
53.	With you, people praise King @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana} like @wDN{Utu} as he rises. 

